#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:5
#: 2b99c53ca5d04f29957b3ae1ccaadc4e
msgid "Starting up and calibrating Plane"
msgstr "启动和校准 Plane"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:7
#: 8cf82138a4fc4cdf84d96f0cce637d86
msgid ""
"This article describes the basic setup and calibration that should be "
"performed before launching Plane."
msgstr "本文描述了在发射 Plane 之前应执行的基本设置和校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:11
#: 2765170debd8401da8bb7353093056ca
msgid "Ground calibration"
msgstr "地面校准"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:13
#: 64f42c61fb6a45ddae37c60da18e0880
msgid ""
"Set your transmitter mode switch to :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>`. This is a "
"safe mode in which to start up the system."
msgstr "将遥控器模式开关设置为 :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>`。这是启动系统的安全模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:16
#: 81792a17a4094d7082a4657d974b9742
msgid ""
"When you power on your board at the field, you should leave the plane "
"motionless on the ground until the :ref:`LEDs <common-leds-pixhawk>` stop "
"flashing blue and red (about 30 seconds). This means that the gyros have "
"been calibrated."
msgstr ""
"在飞行场地为飞控板上电时，您应将飞机静止放置在地面，直到 :ref:`LED <common-leds-pixhawk>` 停止闪烁蓝色和红色（约 30"
" 秒）。这意味着陀螺仪已完成校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:21
#: 0603dc1b749749b7b3800836756e03f8
msgid "Disengage the safety switch (if present)"
msgstr "脱开安全开关（如有）"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:23
#: efb32265518b4f48a5c479b7d9e68d85
msgid ""
"If the autopilot has a :ref:`safety switch <common-safety-switch-pixhawk>` "
"connected, it must be disengaged before the vehicle can be :ref:`armed "
"<arming-your-plane>`."
msgstr ""
"如果飞控连接了 :ref:`安全开关 <common-safety-switch-pixhawk>`，在飞行器可以 :ref:`解锁 <arming-"
"your-plane>` 之前必须先脱开安全开关。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:25
#: 2c4e0a7330cd4ed48fad03f5d6f821fb
msgid "**Safety Switch LED Indications:**"
msgstr "**安全开关 LED 指示：**"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:27
#: 6a97f808a7774e59a5e2d18935827f92
msgid ""
"Fast Blinking indicates: Error Condition, Safety cannot be disengaged. "
"Possibly not calibrated or sensor error."
msgstr "快速闪烁表示：错误状态，无法解除安全锁。可能未完成校准或传感器故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:29
#: a8d3c663beb74cdd93a8af6486b0af5f
msgid ""
"Slow Blinking indicates: Safe condition. Safety can be disengaged by "
"depressing Safety Button for 5 seconds."
msgstr "慢速闪烁表示：安全状态。可以通过按住安全按钮 5 秒来脱开安全开关。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:31
#: 4f3934bb8dca4f58a03fca38071806df
msgid ""
"LED Continuously on indicates: Safety has been disengaged. The autopilot may"
" be armed with Throttle down and to the right."
msgstr "LED 持续亮起表示：安全开关已脱开。飞控可以通过油门向下向右解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:34
#: a3be4593e81f459297d193bfec6d5d70
msgid ""
"When the LED is continuously on indicating Safety Disengaged it may be "
"toggled back to a Safety engaged condition by depressing the Safety button "
"for 5 seconds."
msgstr "当 LED 持续亮起表示安全开关已脱开时，可以通过按住安全按钮 5 秒切换回安全接合状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:40
#: 332b3a051351453e9ac4223c1b4082f0
msgid ""
"Both the Safety engaged and Safety disengaged conditions require the button "
"to be held down for 5 seconds to toggle them. This is a safety mechanism to "
"prevent accidental disarming during flight and accidental arming during "
"transportation."
msgstr "安全接合和安全脱开状态都需要按住按钮 5 秒才能切换。这是一种安全机制，防止飞行中意外上锁和运输中意外解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:46
#: 7c3e54966cee4fd8a454ec30a7bbb9d4
msgid "Calibrate and check the Airspeed sensor (if present)"
msgstr "校准并检查空速传感器（如有）"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:48
#: a67beb1ec13b48a1a255e39ffdacf1ec
msgid ""
"If the vehicle has an :ref:`airspeed sensor <airspeed>` then the :ref:`pre-"
"flight checks described here <calibrating-an-airspeed-sensor>` should be "
"performed before each flight."
msgstr ""
"如果飞行器配备了 :ref:`空速传感器 <airspeed>`，则应在每次飞行前执行 :ref:`此处描述的飞行前检查 <calibrating-"
"an-airspeed-sensor>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:50
#: 0e68721b71c94ca5b01f0dd61205ba16
msgid ""
"Be sure that the pitot ports are lightly covered during boot and/or forced "
"pre-flight calibrations to prevent wind from causing a mis-calibration. And "
"be sure to remove that cover before flight!"
msgstr "确保在启动和/或强制飞前校准期间，皮托管接口被轻轻遮盖，以防风引起校准偏差。飞行前务必取下遮盖！"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:57
#: 815c7ddac4294a29824c382d498293ae
msgid "Wait for GPS lock"
msgstr "等待 GPS 锁定"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:59
#: 43a1c466dc9541f1b2ff416591bf026f
msgid ""
"You should wait for GPS lock before flying which is normally indicated by "
"the autopilot's :ref:`LEDs <common-leds-pixhawk>` becoming green. If you do "
"not wait for GPS lock the barometric altimeter calibration will be incorrect"
" and :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`, :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>`, :ref:`Auto <auto-"
"mode>` and any other GPS dependent modes will not work properly."
msgstr ""
"在飞行前应等待 GPS 锁定，通常以飞控的 :ref:`LED <common-leds-pixhawk>` 变为绿色为标志。如果不等待 GPS "
"锁定，气压高度计校准将不正确，:ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`、:ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>`、:ref:`Auto "
"<auto-mode>` 以及其他任何依赖 GPS 的模式将无法正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:62
#: 5256bb5ea498418ab58a4e3ff1d94125
msgid ""
"For Plane the home position is initially established at the time the plane "
"acquires its GPS lock. It is then continuously updated as long as the "
"autopilot is disarmed."
msgstr "对于 Plane，Home 位置最初在飞机获取 GPS 定位时建立。此后，只要飞控处于上锁状态，Home 位置将持续更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:66
#: 73e553d583db41f29355700a9faf3f10
msgid ""
"This means that if you execute an RTL, your plane will return to the "
"location at which it was armed. If the place you arm is not a good return "
"point then please setup a :ref:`rally point <common-rally-points>` instead. "
"A rally point will be used in preference to the home location for RTL."
msgstr ""
"这意味着如果执行 RTL，飞机将返回解锁时所在的位置。如果解锁地点不是一个好的返航点，请设置一个 :ref:`集结点 <common-rally-"
"points>` 代替。集结点将优先于 Home 位置用于 RTL。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:72
#: 8ffcb8a45ff3482db495007c4085e731
msgid "Check servo movements"
msgstr "检查舵机运动"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:74
#: cc7613e4eed8408daecf997b33f83b51
msgid ""
"**BEFORE EVERY FLIGHT**: before take off, hold the aircraft in your hands "
"and switch to :ref:`FBWA <fbwa-mode>` mode, then pitch and tilt the plane to"
" confirm that the control surfaces move the correct way to return it to "
"level flight. (The ailerons and elevators will move; the rudder only "
"coordinates turns with the ailerons in flight, so it won't move much on the "
"ground). This will ensure that you haven't accidentally reversed a channel."
msgstr ""
"**每次飞行前**：起飞前，用手握住飞行器，切换到 :ref:`FBWA <fbwa-mode>` "
"模式，然后俯仰和倾斜飞机，确认控制面以正确方式移动以使其恢复水平飞行。（副翼和升降舵会移动；方向舵在飞行中仅配合副翼协调转弯，因此在地面上移动不明显）。这将确保您没有意外反向某个通道。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:82
#: 1abc3d407a3742948d0108de7c95a2d3
msgid ""
"You should do this before every flight, just as you move your control "
"surfaces with your RC transmitter to ensure that nothing's reversed. \\ "
"**Failing to do this is the #1 cause of crashes.**"
msgstr "您应该在每次飞行前这样做，就像您用遥控器移动控制面确保没有反向一样。**不这样做是坠机的第一大原因。**"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:88
#: dadf5d5e4b3f4131bef1a2f6dc47be1f
msgid ""
"As a safety measure, your throttle will only arm on the ground in Manual "
"mode, Stabilize or for an autotakeoff in Auto mode. It will not come on in "
"any other Auto mode until you are in motion in the air."
msgstr ""
"作为安全措施，油门只有在地面的 Manual 模式、Stabilize 模式或 Auto 模式的自动起飞中才能解锁。在任何其他 Auto "
"模式中，只有在空中移动后才会启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:97
#: fc37a2cf97ac483a8d65a14cd7aa6aa6
msgid "First flight"
msgstr "首飞"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:99
#: dc8a6dbd9e894ce08015f4ef79e08ea7
msgid ""
"It is highly recommended that you switch into either Stabilize or Fly By "
"Wire mode and observe the behavior of the control surfaces. They should move"
" to return the plane to level when you pitch or roll it. If it isn't rock "
"solid, you can tune the gains by following the instructions \\ :ref:`here "
"<common-tuning>`."
msgstr ""
"强烈建议切换到 Stabilize 或 Fly By Wire "
"模式，观察控制面的行为。当您俯仰或横滚飞机时，它们应该移动以使飞机恢复水平。如果不够稳定，可以按照 :ref:`此处 <common-tuning>` "
"的说明通过调整增益来调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:105
#: bcdd75f156204697abc60d31bbbad733
msgid ""
"If you have not tuned your PID gains then you may like to consider doing the"
" first takeoff in :ref:`AUTOTUNE <autotune-mode>` mode. That will start the "
"tuning process as soon as you takeoff."
msgstr ""
"如果您尚未调整 PID 增益，可以考虑在 :ref:`AUTOTUNE <autotune-mode>` 模式下进行首次起飞。起飞后调参过程将立即开始。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:110
#: e0dad70c37c14709bdafff2e06f6a02d
msgid "Second flight"
msgstr "第二次飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:112
#: 62c1961c15fe43ec97acc98896a117c6
msgid ""
"For your second flight, change the third mode (position 3 of your RC mode "
"switch) to RTL in the Mission Planner's \\ :ref:`mode setup page <common-rc-"
"transmitter-flight-mode-configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"在第二次飞行时，在 Mission Planner 的 :ref:`模式设置页面 <common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-"
"configuration>` 中将第三模式（遥控模式开关的位置 3）更改为 RTL。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:115
#: 56b51f2d2bca45328d69f7252a66b419
msgid ""
"Once in the air switch the vehicle into RTL.  This will test navigation. The"
" aircraft should return to the location at which it armed (or the nearest "
"Rally point) and orbit at a fixed altitude (which can be set with the \\ "
":ref:`Mission Planner <planner:install-mission-planner>`)."
msgstr ""
"在空中时将飞行器切换到 RTL。这将测试导航。飞行器应返回解锁时所在位置（或最近的集结点），并在固定高度盘旋（可通过 :ref:`Mission "
"Planner <planner:install-mission-planner>` 设置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:118
#: 7abfec6c91454fa58399a3816bfab21d
msgid ""
"If it does not return crisply and circle overhead in a near-perfect circle, "
"you need to tune the autopilot a bit for your particular airframe. This can "
"usually be done by adjusting the Roll parameters, as described :ref:`here "
"<roll-pitch-controller-tuning>`."
msgstr ""
"如果它不能干净利落地返回并在头顶近乎完美地盘旋，则需要针对您的特定机体稍微调整飞控。通常可以通过调整横滚参数来完成，如 :ref:`此处 <roll-"
"pitch-controller-tuning>` 所述。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:123
#: 2236cb8a18c74abfa09becd3bafd9fcd
msgid ""
"Once all this has checked out, you can program waypoint missions and test "
"them in Auto mode."
msgstr "一旦所有这些都验证完毕，您可以编写航点任务并在 Auto 模式中测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:127
#: 0c2a8ab6aff04bf8a9e2e7bbb4a7ad55
msgid "Level Adjustment"
msgstr "水平调整"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:129
#: 7cba39d994134502a1ce63a9ed3b1aa7
msgid ""
"You may find after flying your plane in FBWA at the desired cruise throttle "
"setting, that it does not hold level attitude with the transmitter sticks "
"centered. If this happens, perform the following:"
msgstr "您可能会发现，在所需巡航油门设置下以 FBWA 飞行后，飞机在遥控器摇杆居中时无法保持水平姿态。如果发生这种情况，请执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:131
#: 10d5f08fa2534819a98f8c328a635de3
msgid ""
"1) With your autopilot powered on the ground and connected to your mission "
"planner, select FBWA on your transmitter, select the FLIGHT DATA tuning "
"window and plot the nav_roll and nav_pitch data. With your transmitter "
"sticks centered, these should both be zero as shown in this screenshot. If "
"they are not, you need to repeat your RC calibration or adjust your "
"transmitter trims and repeat the FBWA flight test"
msgstr ""
"1) 飞控在地面上电并连接到任务规划软件，在遥控器上选择 FBWA，选择「飞行数据」调参窗口，绘制 nav_roll 和 nav_pitch "
"数据。遥控器摇杆居中时，这两者都应为零，如截图所示。如果不是零，则需要重复遥控器校准，或调整遥控器配平并重复 FBWA 飞行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:141
#: cdbc3e273c284997b4a7efdd3cff4d5f
msgid ""
"If they are zero, then you need to adjust the level trim for the difference "
"in angle between the autopilot board and your planes attitude when flying "
"straight and level, as explained below."
msgstr "如果它们为零，则需要调整飞控板与飞机在直线水平飞行时姿态之间的角度差的水平配平，如下所述。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:144
#: c8fa7fae7e7f4adf8ace9e5f9d6d5f31
msgid ""
"For roll errors (ie heading keeps changing with sticks neutral), use the "
"\"LEVEL\" accelerometer calibrate button in Mission Planner with the wings "
"level using a spirit level and the nose to tail fuselage line of the "
"aircraft also level. Unless the plane is warped this will assure that the "
"wings are level in flight. If the aircraft still rotates in heading with "
"sticks neutral, then you will need to trim the rudder, if equipped, also in "
"flight."
msgstr ""
"对于横滚误差（即摇杆中立时航向不断变化），使用 Mission Planner "
"中的「LEVEL」加速度计校准按钮，在机翼用水平仪保持水平且机头到机尾机身线也水平时进行校准。除非飞机变形，否则这将确保飞行时机翼水平。如果飞机在摇杆中立时仍旋转航向，则需要在飞行中配平方向舵（如有）。"

#: ../../source/docs/starting-up-and-calibrating-arduplane.rst:146
#: 6dc59bb933284ad5bf7d8e619dc7dde9
msgid ""
"If the plane is not generally holding altitude in FBWA at the desired cruise"
" throttle position (ie speed), then you can adjust the cruising pitch "
"attitude using the :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` parameter. Most "
"planes required this to be a few degrees positive for best cruise trim in "
"FBWA. This parameter is in centi-degrees, so 3 degs is 300 for its value."
msgstr ""
"如果飞机在 FBWA 模式下以所需巡航油门位置（即速度）通常无法保持高度，则可以使用 "
":ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` 参数调整巡航俯仰姿态。大多数飞机需要将其设置为几度正值以在 FBWA "
"中获得最佳巡航配平。该参数单位为厘度，因此 3 度对应值为 300。"
